ing your family your house but  what can you do everything is gone taken  by force there's nothing we can do to  stop it the family know they're lucky  and the children already settling at  school if your residence permits they're  also your identification with so much  behind them they say they're now ready  to begin their new lives in the UK Laura  boondock Sky News in East Kent
 

